OL,3,AZelensky says intelligence sharing
OL,4,A'works now' as US envoy to meet Putin
OL,5,Ain Russia
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS special envoy Steve Witkoff has
OL,8,Farrived in Russia to meet President
OL,9,FVladimir Putin after Ukraine's leader
OL,10,Fsaid American intelligence sharing
OL,11,Fabout deadly Russian strikes "works
OL,12,Fnow".
OL,14,FKyiv had accused the US of recently
OL,15,Fwithholding such intelligence, causing
OL,16,FUkrainians to lose their lives - a
OL,17,Fclaim rejected as "scandalous" by
OL,18,FWashington.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
