OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AZelensky says intelligence sharing
OL,4,A'works now' as US envoy to meet Putin
OL,5,Ain Russia
OL,6,
OL,7,FVolodymyr Zelensky was speaking after
OL,8,Fmeeting Witkoff in Oslo on Tuesday for
OL,9,Ftalks later described as "constructive"
OL,10,Fby a US official.
OL,12,FThe Ukrainian president and his
OL,13,FEuropean allies said it was now up to
OL,14,FRussia to respond to the proposals
OL,15,Fagreed in Oslo when Witkoff meets Putin
OL,16,Fin St Petersburg on Wednesday to
OL,17,Fdiscuss measures to end the war.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
